{"skill":{"slug":"polymarket-weather-trader","displayName":"polymarket-weather-trader"},"version":{"version":"1.23.22","createdAt":1789708464718,"changelog":"SIM-5499: per-market position cap (max_buys_per_market, default 1) checked against held positions before entry; run summary prints a per-location skip-reason breakdown. Risk-reducing by default; set 0 for the old unbounded DCA.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","size":20845,"sha256":"2a0c96348aca8f44bcc11a0eea35b88de471b33a8c1b6de161687ea05dc3d344","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"DISCLAIMER.md","size":2349,"sha256":"170ddc045a1a102dbbef48fef95f5350b3e99cf0bec2b5835004b4964d145772","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":30469,"sha256":"2dcea70c06c1ce76a4d9aba4be50ef9351df9a9f6cf2071fae78e9ebb1c5bc55","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"clawhub.json","size":9836,"sha256":"ad02aa34f237f00705aef5a43cbe10ad9d5b874fef4d8b7be2a4f67af8351ae6","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"config.json","size":30,"sha256":"408e6ad78b1723c366adb046de0e168b71e6e9c576c1b4ee6a1c4c8df1a1b58a","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"fixtures/replay_forecasts.sample.json","size":192,"sha256":"4efb33adf835d66f3a351440381afa6fd3960afb5e25ea062ae531368602f9cd","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"scripts/build_replay_forecast_archive.py","size":14481,"sha256":"037f0d773a2110c7fb50ad4b700ec90ec44d2df5ccbe1c7a72668e6c24656a3c","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"scripts/run_backtest_gate.py","size":5700,"sha256":"41f41b5de88c6c549d14ab4bcde7d72e05230ab8ea4aff43ae9cab6334d150d1","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"scripts/status.py","size":4441,"sha256":"f86757d3dfd10826155054f2bdfa7d0c3252e6e6bbe3925916eb48f1cba22142","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"weather_trader.py","size":123319,"sha256":"ab30933671d0ddcc6b7044351d2940339cb2cd5963bdf7d941f766df4afc524f","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2994,"sha256":"06be12c4ded665f6a19ba801ea67f9d36c38e8e5a0aa7eb2adc5683c9ad6a3e1","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789710367020,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"7458dbffc928547a920a58d4c616b4ece92b5dbec5825c3c2d8f5be21d89a4db","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/7458dbffc928547a920a58d4c616b4ece92b5dbec5825c3c2d8f5be21d89a4db","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1789710107152},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":80,"severity":"HIGH","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":8,"checkedAt":1789710367020},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"medium","summary":"This skill is mostly coherent with its trading purpose, but it needs review because it can place real-money trades and one advertised safeguard path can fail open.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access to Simmer, NOAA, and Open-Meteo, plus SIMMER_API_KEY and optional WALLET_PRIVATE_KEY use, is proportionate to a live trading skill but sensitive because it can affect real funds.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The manifest requires simmer-sdk and SIMMER_API_KEY, declares env vars and tunables, and shows no post-install hook, cron, or autostart behavior.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The documentation clearly says dry-run is default and --live is required for real trades, but the code proceeds when market context is unavailable, which can skip advertised slippage/time/resolution safeguards on live orders.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"No system persistence or background service was found. The skill can persist user-directed config changes and user-created replay forecast archives, and keeps only in-process runtime caches.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The main artifact implements the declared Polymarket weather-market workflow: market discovery/import, NOAA/Open-Meteo forecasts, entry/exit logic, and Simmer SDK trade calls. Support scripts for account status and replay backtesting fit that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Review this before installing because it can trade real money. Start in dry-run or TRADING_VENUE=sim, set tight platform caps, avoid providing WALLET_PRIVATE_KEY unless needed, and do not use --live or --no-safeguards until you accept that some safeguards can be bypassed if context data is unavailable.","findings":"[TP4] expected: The archive builder is documented support tooling for replay/backtest workflows and does not replace the main trading script.\n[TP4] expected: The backtest gate is disclosed in SKILL.md as a testing aid; its purpose is narrower than trading but coherent as repository support tooling.\n[TP4] expected: The status script is a disclosed read-only account status command and is coherent with checking weather trading positions.\n[LP3] expected: Credential, network, file-write, and trading capabilities are expected for this skill, but the high-impact live trading path warrants user review and explicit operational controls.\n[AST4] expected: The subprocess call runs a fixed pytest command with an argument list and shell=False; I did not find user-controlled command construction there.\n[E1] expected: Open-Meteo requests send forecast query parameters to a weather API that is disclosed and necessary for the forecast strategy.\n[SDI-1] expected: The module docstring is narrower than the full behavior, but SKILL.md and the manifest disclose Open-Meteo and international market support.\n[SDI-4] expected: The execute_trade docstring is imprecise about side handling, but inspected call sites use it for the documented weather-market trade flow.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789710367020}}}}}